    });

    button.addEventListener("click", function() {
        // Handle click event
        console.log("Button clicked");
    });
});
</script>
```

### Conclusion

By following these guidelines and best practices, you can ensure that your application is more accessible and compliant with WCAG 2.1 AA standards. If you have any further questions or need additional assistance, feel free to ask!

